      "content": "hey i need help w/ something weird. im an intern at a lab and i think i was exposed to some kind of weird particle stream during a calibration error. ever since then i've been seeing these weird colored streaks in my vision. like like if something is about to happen i see these colors before it actually occurs. has anyone ever written about neuro-sensory shifts caused by non-standard particle exposure??",
